<p>See how your own 40-yard dash time compares to these historic marks — and to average times at every level from youth through the pros — in our full <a href="/average-40-yard-dash-times">40-yard dash breakdown by sport and position</a>.</p>

<h2>The Fastest Rookies of 2026, Ranked</h2>
<p>Twenty-two players ran sub-4.40 at this year's combine — a remarkable number given that a record-low 189 total players even ran the drill. Here are the ten fastest official times recorded:</p>
